        "inLanguage": "en-US",
        "mainEntityOfPage": "https://petcureoncology.com/petcure-oncology-acquires-veterinary-mri-and-rt-center-of-new-jersey/",
        "headline": "PetCure Oncology Acquires Veterinary MRI and RT Center of New Jersey",
        "description": "We are pleased to share with you the news that PetCure Oncology has acquired Veterinary MRI and RT Center of New Jersey in Clifton. The practice has been renamed to PetCure Oncology at Veterinary Radiosurgery &amp; Imaging Center (VRIC). PetCure Oncology  was created by the founders of Accelitech, developers of the largest privately held network of stereotactic",
        "articleBody": "We are pleased to share with you the news that PetCure Oncology has acquired Veterinary MRI and RT Center of New Jersey in Clifton. The practice has been renamed to PetCure Oncology at Veterinary Radiosurgery &amp; Imaging Center (VRIC).    PetCure Oncology  was created by the founders of Accelitech, developers of the largest privately held network of stereotactic radiosurgery centers in the human cancer market. The PetCure team brings over a decade's worth of experience in building and running radiosurgery centers, and we are excited to bring our experience in the science and operational administration of leading-edge radiosurgery and imaging to the veterinary market.    The onsite team you have grown to know and trust will continue to serve you and your referred clients with exceptional care. Together, we intend to enhance our shared focus on treating animals suffering from cancers previously thought to be \"untreatable.\"    Two PetCure Oncology centers have already opened - one in Phoenix, Arizona and one in Cincinnati - making this the third in our rapidly growing national network.    For more information about PetCure Oncology at VRIC, please feel free to reach out to me directly with any questions you may have. I also invite you to get in touch with Neal Mauldin, DVM, DACVIM, DACVR, PetCure Oncology Chief Medical Officer, or  JoAnn Stewart, RVT, CVPM, PetCure Oncology Chief Operating Officer.    We look forward to working with you!    Sincerely,    Scott D. Milligan, Chief Executive Officer",
